IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0016.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 INPUT-AREA.
    COPY FEE0016C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    *> FEE WAIVER INDICATOR
    05 FEE-WAIVER-FLG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    *> MONTHLY SERVICE FEE
    05 MTH-FEE            PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT INPUT-AREA
    PERFORM WAIVE-FEE
    DISPLAY "FEE-WAIVER-FLG=" FEE-WAIVER-FLG
    DISPLAY "MTH-FEE=" MTH-FEE
    STOP RUN.
WAIVE-FEE.
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'G'
       OR ACCT-TYP = 'P'
       OR MEAN-BAL >= 2500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FEE-WAIVER-FLG
        MOVE 0 TO MTH-FEE
    ELSE
        MOVE 10 TO MTH-FEE
    END-IF.
